OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWidely dry with bright or sunny
OL,6,Fspells at first, although perhaps a
OL,7,Ffew isolated light showers around.
OL,8,FClouding over a little more during the
OL,9,Fafternoon, but very likely dry and
OL,10,Ffeeling rather warm. Becoming rather
OL,11,Fbreezy towards the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud will thicken overnight
OL,14,Fwith outbreaks of rain moving in from
OL,15,Fthe north, however, some southern
OL,16,Fparts could remain dry until morning.
OL,17,FRather breezy in places and feeling
OL,18,Fmuggy overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
