OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FCloudy skies and outbreaks of
OL,6,Flocally heavy rain are likely in the
OL,7,Fmorning, but the rain should turn
OL,8,Flighter during the afternoon. Lighter
OL,9,Fwinds than Saturday, still feeling
OL,10,Fhumid.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,13,FRemaining changeable over the next few
OL,14,Fdays, with spells of rain or showers
OL,15,Fat times, and feeling increasingly
OL,16,Ffresh. Turning windy as spells of rain
OL,17,Fmove through.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
